      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Moyamoya is a vascular occlusive disease typically limited to the cerebral arterial system. We report a case of severe stenosis of the left main and right coronary arteries occurring in association with moyamoya disease, supporting the concept that moyamoya may be an intracranial manifestation of a systemic arterial disorder."},
